			"notes": "Added: \n- Chorloam Bricks.\n- Cerulean Mosaics.\n\nChanged:\n- Chorloam's collision shape now matches that of mud.\n- Updated to Create 6.0.2.\n- Improved sign textures.\n- Reduced number of necessary mixin classes.\n- Move away from as many accesstransformers as possible in favor of accessor/invoker mixins\n- Cache collision shapes.\n\nFixed:\n- Updated to Oblivion 3.0.0.\n- Gas blocks occluding other blocks."
